flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare insert, debit, and credit SQL]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Disable auto-commit]
    D --> E[Insert transaction row]
    E --> F[Read generated transaction ID]
    F --> G[Debit from_account]
    G --> H{toAccountNo provided?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Credit destination account]
    H -- No --> J[Skip credit]
    I --> K[Commit]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Return true]
    E --> M[On SQL error rollback]
    G --> M
    I --> M
    M --> N[Print stack trace]
    N --> O[Return false]
    C --> P[Outer SQL error]
    P --> N
    L --> Q[End]
    O --> Q
